  "body_html": "<h1>Knapsack Relaxations And Dynamic Programming</h1>\n<p>The algorithmic knapsack layer connects the fractional relaxation,\ndynamic-programming optimum, and integral greedy rule.</p>\n<p>The Lean interface includes feasibility and optimality of the dynamic program,\nand a half-approximation guarantee comparing the integral greedy rule to the\ndynamic-programming optimum.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 12, Sections 12.1-12.3] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos, and\n  Vazirani, <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>, <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>.\n  Approximation mechanisms and allocation algorithms for single-parameter and\n  combinatorial domains.</li>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 11, Section 11.2] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos, and Vazirani,\n  <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>, <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>.\n  Greedy allocation rules, critical payments, and approximation analysis in\n  combinatorial auctions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>thm:auction_knapsack_algorithms</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
